{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 148, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       3      145      464   <- animated\n    Blelloch            7      294      358\n    sequential          7      110      110\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        7 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..51.375\n    d=2        6 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 51.375..102.75\n    d=4        4 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge  t = 102.75..145\n  result: 1 3 6 10 15 21 28 36\n  animation: 420x242, 225 frames at 30 fps (6.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 24.2 cost units; 236204 bytes\n  attached scan.gif (236204 bytes)\n"}, {"type": "image", "data": "", "mimeType": "image/gif"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 148, "ok": true, "cmd": "animate", "ucas": "animate", "structured": false, "result": {"text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       3      145      464   <- animated\n    Blelloch            7      294      358\n    sequential          7      110      110\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        7 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..51.375\n    d=2        6 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 51.375..102.75\n    d=4        4 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge  t = 102.75..145\n  result: 1 3 6 10 15 21 28 36\n  animation: 420x242, 225 frames at 30 fps (6.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 24.2 cost units; 236204 bytes\n  attached scan.gif (236204 bytes)\n"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [{"name": "scan.gif", "mime": "image/gif", "bytes": 236204}], "text": "prefix sum of 8 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n  per element: load 6.875, add 1, barrier 9.125, divergence 20.625\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       3      145      464   <- animated\n    Blelloch            7      294      358\n    sequential          7      110      110\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        7 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..51.375\n    d=2        6 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge +barrier  t = 51.375..102.75\n    d=4        4 ops  lane 21.625 +diverge  t = 102.75..145\n  result: 1 3 6 10 15 21 28 36\n  animation: 420x242, 225 frames at 30 fps (6.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 24.2 cost units; 236204 bytes\n  attached scan.gif (236204 bytes)\n"}, "isError": false}}
