 "a prime l"}]}, {"cmd": "ec_volcano", "description": "the l-isogeny graph around j(E)", "ucas": "ecvolcano", "structured": true, "params": [{"name": "curve", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "secp256k1, P-256, Curve25519, BN254, ..., \"y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97\" or \"[a, b] mod p\""}, {"name": "l", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "a prime <= 13"}]}, {"cmd": "ec_divpoly", "description": "the division polynomial psi_n, its roots and factor degrees (the torsion field)", "ucas": "ecdivpoly", "structured": true, "params": [{"name": "curve", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "secp256k1, P-256, Curve25519, BN254, ..., \"y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97\" or \"[a, b] mod p\""}, {"name": "n", "type": "integer", "required": true, "description": "2 .. 60"}]}, {"cmd": "ec_binary", "description": "a binary curve y^2 + xy = x^3 + a x^2 + b over GF(2^m): count (Koblitz, naive), FIPS parameters checked", "ucas": "ecb2", "structured": true, "params": [{"name": "curve", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "K-163, B-163, K-233, or \"[a, b] over GF(2^13) poly 4 3 1 0\""}, {"name": "mul", "type": "string", "required": false, "description": "k: k G"}]}, {"cmd": "lperm", "description": "a subgroup's lane map (a shuffle's index as a function of lane) as the cheapest proved realisation under the model: exchanges by xor and selects on the lane's bits, a quad's broadcast, or one shuffle", "ucas": "lperm", "structured": true, "params": [{"name": "index", "type": "expression", "required": true, "description": "the lane read, an expression of lane (\"lane xor (lane & 1) << 1\")"}, {"name": "lanes", "type": "integer", "required": false, "description": "the subgroup's size (the lane's range, else the model's warp)"}, {"name": "model", "type": "name", "required": false, "description": "the model (the active one)"}]}, {"cmd": "tcdot", "description": "a tensor core's block FMA (f16 products, f32 accumulate, Ampere's model): its semantic